arcint-stt (1.2.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * First package: whisper.cpp d1be6fde (v1.9.5) built against a ggml
    installed from llama.cpp 3e4dfa8 with arcint's patches 0001-0062 through
    contrib/whisper/build-whisper.sh (WHISPER_USE_SYSTEM_GGML, the Intel
    kernels and the OpenCL backend). The server serves the OpenAI shape at
    /v1/audio/transcriptions through its own --inference-path flag.
    contrib/whisper/server-props.patch adds GET /props and no longer
    serves upstream's /load. Installed as arcint-whisper (and
    arcint-whisper-cli); unit template arcint-stt.service; the STT gate
    tool.

